  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></math> and</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>100</mn></munderover><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Using this&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;can be written as&nbsp;<br /><math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>198</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>200</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>101</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Similarly,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>300</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>101</mn></math><br />So, the required quadratic equation is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>102</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>101</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p>"
